+	 * duration defaulted to HCI_DEFAULT_ADV_DURATION (2s) and the expire
+	 * work kept tearing down LE Set Adv Enable — phones saw nothing even
+	 * though MGMT ADD_ADVERTISING / RegisterAdvertisement returned OK.
